    "Compare geocentric epicycle-based explanations with heliocentric explanations and evaluate parsimony.",
    "Predict when retrograde motion will occur for an outer planet based on relative orbital positions and periods.",
    "Compare the apparent retrograde loops of Mars, Jupiter, and Saturn and explain why distant planets show smaller loops."
